Regarding the aerial images of the Munich rally;
We usually imagine a large open space and estimate the population by eye, a land the size of a football field. Many times, the Islamic Republic has claimed that hundreds of thousands of people gathered by filling a sports stadium. 
And it is interesting to know that the area of ​​today's Munich area is equal to 58 football fields.

